## Kiro Buddy

Character animations, the pet sprite frames, and the agent-status system are
based on **Kiro Buddy** by Jagatees:

https://github.com/Jagatees/kiro-buddy

Kiro Guard wraps that work in a screen-cover experience for Windows.

---

Why this file exists rather than a section appended to `LICENSE`: GitHub's
license detection (`licensee`) requires roughly 98% similarity to a known
license template. Appending an attribution block to `LICENSE` dropped it below
that threshold, so GitHub reported the project as `NOASSERTION` — no MIT badge,
and automated license scanners read Kiro Guard as unlicensed. `LICENSE` is now
verbatim MIT and attribution lives here.
